SUMMARY:Triibü
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Underground dance\n\nTRiiBü draws inspiration from a wide ran
 ge of rhythms\, cultures\, and sounds shaped by underground dance music f
 rom around the world. Built around the idea that music can bring differen
 t people\, energies\, and backgrounds into the same space\, the project f
 ocuses on creating a feeling of shared movement\, connection\, and flow o
 n the dance floor. At its core\, TRiiBü is about bringing people into a 
 shared flow through music and movement.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfest
 ival.com/products/triibu
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1ed3fa68-25ea-4f17-8828-6b2a239a1145@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260618T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260618T230000
SUMMARY:Sidelines
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:UK bass / Dubstep • Kootenays / Salt Spring Island BC\n\nOri
 ginating from the Kootenays\, SIDELINES is a 26-year-old DJ and producer 
 shaped by the region's legendary mountains and bush rave culture. Also he
 avily influenced by UK Sound\, R&B\, Wobbly Dubstep and Fat Basslines. Kn
 own for high-energy sets that keep dance floors shuffling and skanking ti
 ll the break of dawn. Currently residing on Salt Spring Island BC\, striv
 ing to create original tracks and throw down on big sound systems across 
 the province.\n\nhttps://soundcloud.com/elias-sweringn\nhttps://www.insta
 gram.com/sidelinesbc/\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/
 sidelines
END:VEVENT
