DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T003000
SUMMARY:Tempeh
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Dubstep / Bass\n\nTempeh is a producer focused on dubstep\, ba
 ss weight\, and deep atmospheric selections. His sound leans into spaciou
 s low-end\, rolling rhythms\, and the darker energy of underground sound.
 \n\nhttps://soundcloud.com/ty_dale\nhttps://www.instagram.com/tempehmusic
 /\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/tempeh
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ef6f1bab-3c18-42cb-b1ea-e07f90f76407@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T003000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T020000
SUMMARY:Dyce
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Garage / Breaks / Jungle / Footwork • Vancouver Island\n\nFr
 om deep shuddering basslines to rolling 808s and high energy breaks\, DYC
 E delivers a memorable sonic experience. His live performances span a vas
 t musical landscape\, from Garage\, Breaks\, and Jungle to Chicago Footwo
 rk. DYCE delivers hand picked gems from a multitude of underground music 
 outlets and influences. Generating waves in the Island scene\, his sets a
 re characterized by precision blends\, intricate selection\, and an energ
 etic stage presence.\n\nhttps://www.instagram.com/_dyce_/\nhttps://soundc
 loud.com/frazer-dyson\nhttp://linktr.ee/DYCE.DJ\n\nProfile: https://thene
 ctarfestival.com/products/dyce
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e19f4aa8-f0fb-43a7-b774-0bf2878a6417@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T210000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260619T223000
SUMMARY:Löblová
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:UKG / breakbeat / DnB / downtempo / techno\n\nLöblová is ded
 icated to curating unique and thoughtful sound experiences\, made to full
 y immerse you in the dance. She doesn’t follow a script—she reads the
  room and builds from instinct. Moving fluidly through UKG\, breakbeat\, 
 DnB\, downtempo\, house\, techno\, and trance\, each set is shaped from i
 nspiration in the moment.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/produ
 cts/loblova
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
