DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T000000
SUMMARY:Triikstr
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:High-impact / underground • BC\n\nTRiiKSTR is a BC-based DJ 
 and event producer known for shaping immersive\, high-impact dancefloor e
 xperiences across underground and festival settings. Rooted in queer\, fe
 tish\, and rave communities\, their work is driven by energy\, tension\, 
 and connection\, creating sets that feel intentional\, magnetic\, and har
 d to step away from.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/t
 riikstr
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
