DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T013000
SUMMARY:Audacity
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Tech house / bass house • Vancouver\n\nBased in Vancouver\, 
 Audacity has been carving out a distinct lane in the tech house and bass 
 house scene with a curated sound that leans into grindy textures\, deep g
 rooves\, and dark\, rolling basslines. A regular presence across the West
  Coast\, Audacity has performed extensively on Vancouver Island.\n\nProfi
 le: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/audacity
END:VEVENT
