DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T043000
SUMMARY:KiiK
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Dark / hypnotic / psychedelic\n\nDark\, hypnotic\, and relentl
 ess. KIIK brings heat to the booth and sweat to the dance floor. Her sets
  are deep\, dark\, and physical - built on rolling basslines\, moody text
 ures\, and rhythms that lock you in. Blending hypnotic elements and psych
 edelic sounds\, she knows how to push the energy.\n\nProfile: https://the
 nectarfestival.com/products/kiik
END:VEVENT
