SUMMARY:Dose.
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:90s Trance / Hard House / Techno\n\nDose. is the multifaceted 
 DJ & music project from partners Max & Taylor. With deep selections that 
 traverse fluidly through genres like 90s Trance\, Hard House\, and Techno
 \, their artistic vision is rooted in sharing raw expression from the hea
 rt. Their sets are curated as a free-flowing and intuitive exploration.\n
 \nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/dose
END:VEVENT
