SUMMARY:Ciscles
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:140 / grime / 2-step / jungle • Vancouver\n\nciscles is a pr
 oducer\, DJ\, and multi-instrumentalist based in Vancouver\, BC\, and a f
 ixture of the West Coast’s underground bass scene for the past decade. 
 His rich musical taste is deeply woven into his eclectic and genre-defyin
 g sets\, encompassing everything from 140\, grime\, 2-step\, jungle\, R
 ’n’B and beyond.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/c
 iscles
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:88986b9a-0163-472b-9ffb-6aee6958c0dc@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T213000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T230000
SUMMARY:N1ghtwork
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:UK-inspired bass • East Van\n\nNight Work is an East Van DJ/
 producer crafting wavey UK-inspired bass music rooted in beatmaking and s
 ampling culture. Drawing on influences from R&B\, rap\, and 140-driven cl
 ub sounds\, his bass-heavy style — defined by 808 weight\, chopped voca
 ls\, and melodic fragments — is built for low-lit dance floors.\n\nProf
 ile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/night-work
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:1d681b4f-c178-49ca-94a8-921ba6fcaeea@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260620T230000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T003000
SUMMARY:Destrata
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Genre-fluid underground • Vancouver\n\nVancouver-based DJ an
 d producer Destrata is never one to be limited by a genre or style. Havin
 g released a string of EPs on notable underground labels such as Scuffed 
 Recordings\, !K7\, Spe:C\, and Of Paradise\, he garnered the attention of
  Mixmag and was listed in their 25 Artists to Watch in 2024 feature.\n\nP
 rofile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/destrata
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:0b95e23e-cd08-41cf-b3ac-9b24a60a51a7@nectar2026
