DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T003000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T020000
SUMMARY:Pigeon Hole
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Bass / Dubstep • Vancouver Island\n\nVeteran Vancouver Islan
 d\, BC-based producer Pigeon Hole pushes the boundaries of their sound an
 d sound systems alike. Known for a longstanding catalogue of bass music a
 nd dubstep\, they experiment with evolving song structures and heavyweigh
 t sound design\, resulting in a high-energy sound and live show.\n\nProfi
 le: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/pigeon-hole
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:e0115d96-965f-4250-93a2-92b81422aef4@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T020000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T033000
SUMMARY:Daega Sound
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Dubstep / dub • West Coast\n\nDaega Sound is a Canadian elec
 tronic music and DJ duo formed by brothers Ben and Josh Searles. Since em
 erging from the West Coast in 2008\, they’ve carved out an internationa
 l reputation for their deep\, heavy\, and meticulously crafted dubstep 
 — a sound rooted in low-end pressure and sonic integrity.\n\nProfile: h
 ttps://thenectarfestival.com/products/daega-sound
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
