DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T160000
SUMMARY:Dubconscious
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Reggae / dub / jungle / soundsystem • Nelson\n\nRaised on am
 ens\, Reese basslines and ragga chat in Toronto’s vibrant jungle scene\
 , Dubconscious now calls Nelson home where he continues to weave cohesive
  sound tapestries coloured by his unique influences and handpicked sounds
  & styles — generally rooted in reggae / dub / soundsystem culture.\n\n
 Profile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/dubconscious
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
