DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T160000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T173000
SUMMARY:Hostilis
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Dubstep / dub / dub techno • Victoria\n\nComing to us from V
 ictoria with his Sacred Roots Soundsystem\, Hostilis brings a deep passio
 n for authentic soundsystem culture and the music crafted specifically fo
 r these powerful rigs. His sets traverse the rich territories of dubstep\
 , dub\, and dub techno\, all deeply rooted in the traditions of reggae an
 d soundsystem culture.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products
 /hostilis
END:VEVENT
