DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T190000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T203000
SUMMARY:Lady K
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Afro / bass house / Amapiano / hip-hop • Comox Valley\n\nLad
 yK is a veritable musical force in the Comox Valley\, Vancouver Island. S
 he has been DJing regularly for 15 years\, producing for 7 years\, and pr
 oducing the Sexy Lady Show for 3 years. Her musical vibe includes Afro an
 d bass house\, Amapiano\, hip hop\, R&B and more.\n\nProfile: https://the
 nectarfestival.com/products/ladyk
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:05475d40-7dbd-4a11-854d-cee73ae4a4c1@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T203000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T220000
SUMMARY:Inphini
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Deep frequency / psychedelic\n\nCharting the unseen geometry o
 f the sonic leading edge. Resonance of a mind folding into the infinite 
 — a liquid transition between the terrestrial and the void. A slow-bloo
 ming frequency\, vibrating through the silence of a cosmic forest where l
 ight becomes sound. Deep-frequency love.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfes
 tival.com/products/inphini
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:83427890-adb3-46c8-afb0-82e39b76a773@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T220000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260621T233000
SUMMARY:Matsya
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:All-tempo / eclectic\n\nFor nearly two decades\, Manuel Rochet
 te aka Matsya has been involved from the ground up with festivals and eve
 nts. Polymath in nature\, Matsya brings timely selections playing across 
 all tempos and a wild variance in styles. His sets are unique and tastefu
 lly unpredictable\, from current dance beats to atmospheric ambient.\n\nP
 rofile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/matsya
END:VEVENT
