UID:835a2dbc-4838-4236-b356-bd2a26396219@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260622T010000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260622T023000
SUMMARY:Murge
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Downtempo / bass • Loci Records\n\nA sonic alchemist\, murge
  weaves the eclectic and the electric to create dancefloor-centric beats 
 that fill the space and lift the crowd. Unorthodox sounds intertwine to c
 reate an expansive aural journey filled with fresh\, earthy bass and neot
 eric instrumentals. He was signed to Emancipator’s label Loci Records i
 n 2020.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/murge
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:ec5b76ad-6bcd-4baa-9a83-e54a41aca46e@nectar2026
DTSTAMP:20260615T233644Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260622T023000
DTEND;TZID=America/Vancouver:20260622T040000
SUMMARY:The Silk Road
LOCATION:Nectar Stage
DESCRIPTION:Global / world bass • Afghan-Nepalese duo\n\nExplore the wor
 ld with Yelda and Biplov – an Afghan and Nepalese DJ duo sharing global
  beats on the dance floor. Together they ignite a vision of global connec
 tion inspired by the true-life historic Silk Road. Their musical diversit
 y of light and dark energy combines forces to create the magic of The Sil
 k Road.\n\nProfile: https://thenectarfestival.com/products/the-silk-road
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:da4d8a95-5858-485b-b391-b1bd4a2adf26@nectar2026
